                content: "Building digital sovereignty from Idukki. Arch user, hardware tinkerer, P2P enthusiast."
                css: "font-size: 20px; color: #7f8c8d; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;"

          # Excited GIF
          - ::
            type: "image"
            content: "https://media.giphy.com/media/nDSlfqf0gn5g4/giphy.gif"
            css: "width: 100px; margin: 0 auto 50px auto; display: block; border-radius: 8px;"

          # About Section
          - ::
            type: "section-container"
            css: "margin-bottom: 60px;"
            children::
              - ::
                type: "heading"
                content: "About"
                css: "font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; color: #2c3e50; margin: 0 0 25px 0; border-bottom: 2px solid #3498db; padding-bottom: 10px;"

              - ::
                type: "markdown-text"
                mode: "markdown"
                content: "I'm the founder of **Osvauld**, building peer-to-peer, end-to-end encrypted applications for people who value digital sovereignty.\n\nI believe the internet should work without intermediaries. No platforms controlling your identity. No servers deciding who sees your content. Just direct connections between people.\n\n**What I'm working on:**\n- 🔐 **Livnote** - P2P collaborative notes and documents\n- 🌐 **Sthalam** - Sovereign publishing without platforms\n- 🏠 **Sovereign Nodes** - Run your own internet infrastructure\n\n**Background:**\n- Built fully decentralized applications from scratch\n- Passionate about cryptography, CRDT synchronization, and P2P networks\n- Funded by Kerala Startup Mission (Productization Grant 2024-25)\n- Open source everything - MIT licensed\n\n**Tech & Hobbies:**\n- 🐧 Daily driver: Arch Linux (btw)\n- 🔌 Hardware prototyping and embedded systems\n- 🏔️ Based in Idukki, Kerala\n- ☕ Powered by filter coffee\n\nWhen I'm not coding, I'm probably tinkering with hardware, thinking about how to make self-hosting easier for everyone, or exploring the hills of Idukki."
                css: "color: #34495e; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0;"

